  "description": "Darb Budokai on your phone: your character sheet and today’s quests, check-ins that work with no signal, and a home-screen widget whose health and stamina change with your real day.",
  "mark": {
    "meaning": "The living widget: a home-screen tile with your character’s two vitals. Health is the outer ring, stamina the inner one; here stamina has run low because you have been slouching since lunch. It is the app’s signature, and it is the capsule idea in miniature: a whole character carried in your pocket.",
    "hero": "Press and throw: a capsule thrown, a burst of vapour, and your vitals unfolding out of it. Open the app and your whole sheet is there, even with no signal."
